# iSkating repository ignore rules
# 默认忽略所有文件；下面只放行源码、工程配置和前端关键文件。

*
!*/

# ---- keep source / config files ----
!.gitignore
!*.c
!*.cc
!*.cpp
!*.cxx
!*.h
!*.hh
!*.hpp
!*.hxx
!*.pro
!*.pri
!*.ui
!*.qrc
!*.qss
!*.vue
!*.js
!*.json
!*.html
!*.css
!*.md

# ---- keep required static assets referenced by qrc / Vue ----
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.svg
!*.ico

# ---- Visual Studio / generated project files ----
.vs/
*.sln
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.*
*.vcproj
*.vcproj.*
*.user
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.ipch

# ---- Qt / qmake generated files ----
.qmake.stash
Makefile
Makefile.*
*.Debug
*.Release
moc/
rcc/
ui/
obj/

# ---- build output directories ----
debug/
release/
x64/
build/
bin/
dist/
out/

# ---- compiled / binary / debug artifacts ----
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.dll
*.exe
*.exp
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.idb
*.res
*.rcc
*.moc
*.pch
*.manifest

# ---- Node / frontend generated files ----
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.cache/
coverage/

# ---- OS / editor temporary files ----
.agents/
.codex/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
